      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "The skill performs significant file read and write operations (reading PDFs, writing merged/split/encrypted/watermarked PDFs, writing Excel spreadsheets) but declares no explicit tool scope or permissions boundary. This means the skill can silently access and overwrite arbitrary files on the filesystem without any declared constraint, broadening its attack surface beyond what a user might expect.",
      "remediation": "Add an explicit 'permissions' or 'allowed-tools' block to the skill manifest that enumerates only the file access operations required (e.g., file_read, file_write) and ideally restricts paths to user-specified locations. This gives the runtime environment and the user visibility into the skill's actual capabilities.",
