      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "The description massively over-declares the skill's capabilities. The code does NOT implement: merging/combining PDFs, splitting PDFs, rotating pages, adding watermarks, creating new PDFs from scratch, encrypting/decrypting PDFs, extracting images from PDFs, or OCR on scanned PDFs. The code's actual scope is form filling (both fillable and non-fillable PDFs), with supporting utilities like converting pages to images for visual validation and extracting form structure. While \"filling PDF forms\" is mentioned in the description, it is only one of many capabilities claimed, whereas it is essentially the entire purpose of the actual code. The description would cause the skill to be invoked for many PDF tasks it cannot perform (merging, splitting, rotating, watermarking, encrypting, OCR, etc.).",
      "remediation": "Update the skill description to accurately reflect all capabilities, or remove undeclared functionality from the implementation.",
      "code_snippet": null,
      "intent": null,
      "tags": [
        "ASI02",
        "AML.T0080",
        "llm-unconfirmed"
      ]
    },
    {
