      "finding": null,
      "explanation": "The skill writes an Excel (.xlsx) output file ('extracted_tables.xlsx') as a side effect of table extraction, which is not disclosed in the skill description or manifest. Users expecting only PDF operations may be surprised by the creation of additional file types on their filesystem. While unlikely to be exploited maliciously, undisclosed file output is a transparency concern and could overwrite existing files with the same name.",
      "remediation": "Either add Excel/spreadsheet export to the skill's declared capabilities in the manifest description, or refactor the example to write CSV or return data in-memory, letting the calling code decide where to persist results. At minimum, ensure the output path is user-supplied or clearly communicated before writing.",
      "code_snippet": null,
      "intent": null,
      "tags": []
